# 统一换行符，避免 Windows 上编辑过的 .yaml / .j2 提交后整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须保留 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析出错
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制：别做换行转换，也别让 git 把它当文本 diff
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
